                either 3.3 or 5 V logic — in this course we use 3.3 V.</caption>
                <image source="images/Day13-I2C(3)/stemma_wiring.svg" width="92%"/>
            </figure>

            <slide xml:id="sl-day13-wiring" ref="fig-accel-wiring">
